\ollabel{def:main-op}
\emph{!!{main operator}} saka !!a{formula}~$!A$
ditetepake kaya mangkene:
\begin{enumerate}
\item \indcase*{!A}{!A}{$\indfrm$ ora nduweni !!{main operator}.}

