\begin{history}
Formation sequences were introduced by Raymond Smullyan in his
textbook \emph{First-Order Logic} \citep{Smullyan1968}.
Additional properties of formation sequences were established by
\citet{Zuckerman1973}.
\end{history}

target.raw_text:
