yen lan mung yen $\Sat{M}{!A}[s_2]$.
\end{prop}

source.raw_text:
\begin{proof}
We use induction on the complexity of $!A$. For the base case, where
$!A$ is atomic, $!A$ can be:
\iftag{prvTrue}{$\ltrue$,}{}
\iftag{prvFalse}{$\lfalse$,}{}
$\Atom{R}{t_1, \dots, t_k}$ for a $k$-place predicate $R$ and terms
$t_1$, \dots,~$t_k$, or $\eq[t_1][t_2]$ for terms $t_1$ and~$t_2$.
In the latter two cases, we only demonstrate the forward direction of
the !!{biconditional}, since the proof of the reverse is symmetrical.

target.raw_text:
\begin{proof}
Kita nggunakake induksi miturut keruwetan $!A$. Ing kasus dhasar,
nalika $!A$ atom, $!A$ bisa awujud:
\iftag{prvTrue}{$\ltrue$,}{}
\iftag{prvFalse}{$\lfalse$,}{}
$\Atom{R}{t_1, \dots, t_k}$ kanggo predikat $k$-panggonan $R$
lan term $t_1$, \dots,~$t_k$, utawa $\eq[t_1][t_2]$ kanggo term
$t_1$ lan~$t_2$. Ing rong kasus pungkasan, kita mung nuduhake
arah maju saka !!{biconditional}, amarga bukti arah walike simetris.

