Suppose that $\Gamma \cup \{ \lexists[x][!S] \}$ and $\Delta$ are
inseparable, and $c$ is a new !!{constant} not in $\Gamma$, $\Delta$,
or $!S$. Then $\Gamma \cup \{ \lexists[x][!S], \Subst{!S}{c}{x} \}$
and $\Delta$ are also inseparable.
\end{lem}

